Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.09,0:09:00.23,Solo-Main,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Perfeito.\NCom isso encerrei o 89º andar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:05.11,Solo-Main,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Igris e Tank subiram de rank\Ngraças aos níveis que ganharam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.73,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(186,1)\an7\bord1.5\p1)\c&H1F0C0F&\3a&H00&\1a&H63&\3c&HD58AAE&\pos(54.22,9.93)}m 0 0 l 220 0 220 150 0 150
