Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.31,0:21:33.48,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\fs12\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H74554C&\fnArial\blur5\pos(240.56,207.56)}Você obteve a alma de Baran.
